{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271140","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1027114001:0":{"text":"*Sigh*... they're finally gone. I hope they don't come back...","source_cn":"呼……它们终于走了，不会突然又跑回来吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561457493459A7E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1027114001":{"text":"*Sigh*... they're finally gone. I hope they don't come back...","source_cn":"呼……它们终于走了，不会突然又跑回来吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561457493459A7E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027114002:0":{"text":"I'm alright, thanks...","source_cn":"谢谢，我没事……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B5B6770F6B51C20","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm alright, thanks...","female":"I'm alright, thanks...","variant_male_record_index":"109309","variant_female_record_index":"109310","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027114004:0":{"text":"... It's so strange. The glimmerblooms have always stayed far away from the village. Why did these ones show up suddenly and attack? ","source_cn":"……太奇怪了。荧荧花一向远离村落附近，这两只为什么会突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8AF0EF85A09B1FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027114005:0":{"text":"And fleeing like that... it doesn't seem like they intended to do any real harm. ","source_cn":"而且，它们见势不对就立刻逃跑，说明目的不是要伤害我们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325849310E776B0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027114006:0":{"text":"Where's Petal? How's Petal?! Have any of you seen Petal?! ","source_cn":"一叶呢，一叶怎么样了？！你们有谁看见一叶了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04DFE4928DF6F2E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1027114006":{"text":"Where's Petal? How's Petal?! Have any of you seen Petal?! ","source_cn":"一叶呢，一叶怎么样了？！你们有谁看见一叶了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04DFE4928DF6F2E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027114007:0":{"text":"She can't run too far! If someone finds out about her, she's done for... we have to find her quickly!","source_cn":"她不能跑太远呀！要是被人发现就糟了，得赶快找到她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D425764654794A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027114008:0":{"text":"We'll go with you to keep you safe.","source_cn":"我们和你一起去，以免路上又有危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD610EEC4EAA931FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Must've ran pretty far. ","source_cn":"好像跑远了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE611D79F8F20264","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Must've ran pretty far. ","female":"Must've ran pretty far. ","variant_male_record_index":"61198","variant_female_record_index":"61199","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"Are you okay?","source_cn":"你没事吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6BE3CE5F6DE64D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you okay?","female":"Are you okay?","variant_male_record_index":"61194","variant_female_record_index":"61195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027114003:0":{"text":"I-I was too scared to react. ","source_cn":"我、我只是被吓到了，没反应过来而已……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x31D35D516BF28B1D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I-I was too scared to react. ","female":"I-I was too scared to react. ","variant_male_record_index":"109311","variant_female_record_index":"109312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Where was your \"amazing invention\"...? ","source_cn":"你的“厉害发明”呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFE93591391326E09","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Where was your \"amazing invention\"...? ","female":"Where was your \"amazing invention\"...? ","variant_male_record_index":"61196","variant_female_record_index":"61197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:达米安":{"text":"Damian","source":"达米安","status":"matched_dialogu